   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">2DDEDJ1 NO FILM, NO VIDEO, NO TV, NO DOCUMENTARY - File photo of Salesforce founder and CEO Marc Benioff speaks during the grand opening of the Salesforce Tower, the tallest building in San Francisco, CA, USA, Tuesday, May 22, 2018. Time magazine is being sold by Meredith to Marc Benioff, a co-founder of Salesforce, and his wife, it was announced on Sunday. Meredith announced that it was selling Time magazine for Dollars 190m in cash to Benioff, one of four co-founders of Salesforce, a cloud computing pioneer. Photo by Karl Mondon/Bay Area News Group/TNS/ABACAPRESS.COM</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
