   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">In this Thursday, Nov. 9, 2017, photo, Jeanelle Bass, an assistant manager at a Walmart in Mays Landing, N.J., wears virtual reality goggles while participating in an interactive session at the Walmart Academy at a Walmart store in North Bergen, N.J. (AP Photo/Julio Cortez)</rdf:li>
